<title>USA: Group cuts stake in Bio-Technology.</title>
<headline>Group cuts stake in Bio-Technology.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Elliot Associates LP said Thursday it cuts its stake in Bio-Technology General Corp to 2,778,988 common shares or 6.24 percent from 9.01 percent held in May.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include net sales of 628,100 common shares sold between July 16 and Sept 4 at prices ranging from $6.462 to $9.625 per share.</p>
</text>
